# 3-arg case: dict pattern dispatch on a "tag" field (simulating Ok/Error variant dispatch).
# Match arms check the tag field and bind the value field.
[match [tag: "ok"  value: 42]
  [case [let v] [tag: "ok"   value: v] [str "got " [str v]]]
  [case [let e] [tag: "error" value: e] [str "err " e]]
  [case [let _] _ "other"]]
=== out
String("got 42")
